# Patterns are gitignore-style: an UNANCHORED pattern like `docs/` matches at
# every level, which previously also excluded public/data/docs/ and 404'd the
# checklist PDF. Every rule here is anchored with a leading slash on purpose.
/claude-impact-lab-uci-main.zip
/claude-impact-lab-uci-main/
/research/
/scripts/
/docs/
/tests/
/data/raw/
/data/tools/
/.github/
/AGENTS.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
